# The desk is Windows and the fleet is Linux. Normalise to LF in the
# repository so a systemd unit or a shell script checked out on a node is
# not delivered with CRLF, whatever anyone's core.autocrlf happens to be.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary. Never touch these.
*.onnx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.safetensors binary
*.zip binary
